          "id": "derive-1-2",
          "claim": "Suppose $\\alpha \\in \\omega$ with $\\alpha \\approx \\omega$; then $\\alpha \\in \\mathbb{N}$ and $\\mathbb{N} \\approx \\alpha$, which [L1] forbids; so $\\omega$ is a cardinal, and claim (a) holds. [L1, L4]",
