63:[L2] $2^{\lvert A \rvert} = \lvert \mathcal{P}(A)\rvert$ for every set $A$, and $\kappa < 2^{\kappa}$ ([[thm-cardinal-power-set-and-cantor]], [[def-cardinal-arithmetic]]).
