73:[L7] $\omega$ is a limit ordinal ([[lem-omega-least-limit-ordinal]]); ordinals satisfy trichotomy, $\bigcup$ of a set of ordinals is its least upper bound, and $\alpha \subseteq \beta$ iff $\alpha \in \beta$ or $\alpha = \beta$ ([[lem-ordinal-basics]], [[lem-ordinal-trichotomy]], [[def-injection-surjection-bijection]]).
