171:**F-B1 — `thm-cardinal-arithmetic-agrees-with-finite-counting` [L3]: DECLINED as proposed; a corrected repair is APPROVED in its place.**
172-
173-The Beta proposed deleting [L3] and dropping `lem-omega-least-limit-ordinal` and
174-`def-ordinal` from `deps`. **[L3] is uncited but it is not unused, and deleting it
175-would create the exact defect this audit exists to remove.**
