40-#### A1. fs-cardinal-exponentiation-is-strictly-monotone-in-the-base: Cantor's inequality is misidentified as exponent-slot strictness
41-
42-The Statement explanation currently says:
43-
44-> strictness does hold in the other slot, where $\kappa < 2^{\kappa}$ at every cardinal
45-
46-The Remark currently says:
