      "claim": "The set $C = \\{\\aleph_n : n \\in \\omega\\}$ exists by Replacement, and $C \\subseteq \\aleph_\\omega$ because $n \\in \\omega$ gives $\\aleph_n \\in \\aleph_\\omega$ by the strict increase in [L1] and [L2]. [L1, L2, L6]",
