 title: "$\\kappa < \\kappa^{\\operatorname{cf}(\\kappa)}$ for every infinite cardinal $\\kappa$, and $\\operatorname{cf}(2^{\\kappa}) > \\kappa$; in particular $\\operatorname{cf}(2^{\\aleph_0}) > \\aleph_0$"
 status: published
